ca2128f76f51e12b27200d44ab787ee2a077635483e85aeb47bb62c6c315","file":"preprints/An-Integral-Degree-Three-Gersten-Counterexample-September-26-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":29,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"366eabc41a26807755424d9f1566ec7976264c93307dba6eda9d5b8e9aedccf8","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/An-Integral-Degree-Three-Gersten-Counterexample-September-26-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:0497ca2128f76f51e12b27200d44ab787ee2a077635483e85aeb47bb62c6c315","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/An-Integral-Degree-Three-Gersten-Counterexample-September-26-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L29"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nThe ring $A$ is a two-dimensional Noetherian regular local domain\nof mixed characteristic $(0,5)$, with $\\pi\\in\\mathfrak m_A^2$.\nThere is an integral class $c\\in K_3(A)$ such that\n\\[\n c|_{\\Frac A}=0,\n \\qquad\n c|_{A[1/\\pi]}\\bmod5\\ne0\n \\quad\\text{in }G_3(A[1/\\pi];\\Z/5).\n\\]\nIn particular, $K_3(A)\\to K_3(\\Frac A)$ is not injective."}
